.TH batten-record-suites 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-record\-suites \- Derive what each bats suite costs from the report the runner wrote, and record it where an author reads it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten record suites\fR [\fB\-\-write\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
